 class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"mobile-hidden game-font-face advanced-tooltip\" style=\"position: relative; user-select: none;z-index: 5;color: #ffffff8f;font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"dottedText C(#3a3a3a)-Th-L\" style=\"position: absolute; top: -43px; right: 0; cursor: help; border-bottom: 2px dotted;\">Why do I have different stats?</div><div class=\"tooltip-contents\" style=\"display: none\"><div class=\"game-tooltip&#95;&#95;container game-font-face\">Units in this game use a randomized system, where stats like damage are randomly rolled with about a 10% variance (like Dungeon Quest items). When you evolve a unit they also reroll their stats, but it will always be strictly better than the pre-evolved version.</div></div></div><div class=\"article-table mobileonly\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Frequently_Asked_Questions\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions\">Why do I have different stats?</a></i><br /></div><div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; z-index: 5;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; width: 124px; justify-content: flex-start; position: absolute; left: 234px; top: -48px; flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: center;\">\n<div class=\"mw-customtoggle-Buff&#95;OFF mw-customtoggle-Buff&#95;ON\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Buff&#95;ON\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; width: 100px;\">\n<div class=\"buffList\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-content: center; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100%;\">\n<p>Buff\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Buff&#95;OFF\" style=\"display: none; transform: translate(0, -70px);\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: center;gap: 3px;\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; width: 100px;\">\n<div class=\"buffList\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-content: center; justify-content: center; align-items: center;