" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;SkyEnchantment H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;KannonbirakiBenihimeAratame H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h3><span id=\"Upgrade_1_-_1.C2.A5_Hits:_4Attacks_4_times_in_a_single_attack._Damage_stated_by_the_unit_itself_will_be_divided_by_the_number_of_hits._This_can_take_out_that_number_of_shields_from_enemy_units.2C_and_can_potentially_1-shot_2-barred_enemies._2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Upgrade_1_-_1¥_Hits:_4Attacks_4_times_in_a_single_attack._Damage_stated_by_the_unit_itself_will_be_divided_by_the_number_of_hits._This_can_take_out_that_number_of_shields_from_enemy_units,_and_can_potentially_1-shot_2-barred_enemies._2\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\"><span>Upgrade 1 - <span class=\"game-font-face Tsh(Game) C(Yen)\">1¥</span></span> <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"font-size: 90%; align-self: center; gap: 9px; display: flex; padding: 0 9px;\"><span class=\"advanced-tooltip Stats-Box-dotted&#95;Effect\"><span class=\"C(wiki-theme-page)\" style=\"pointer-events: none;\">Hits: 4</span><div class=\"tooltip-contents mobile-hidden\" style=\"display: none;\"><div class=\"game-tooltip&#95;&#95;container game-font-face\">Attacks 4 times in a single attack. Damage stated by the unit itself will be divided by the number of hits. This can take out that number of shields from enemy units, and can potentially 1-shot 2-barred enemies.</div></div></span> </span></div></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Damage: <span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sakura\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\">173,220.<small>5</small> </span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\">346,441.<small>01</small> </span></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sakura\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\">190,542.<small>55</small> </span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\">363,763.<small>06</small> </span></span> </li><li>Range: <span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\">40</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\">48</span></li><li>SPA: <span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\">7.<small>6</small></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\">6.<small>84</small></span></li><li>DPS: <span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sakura\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\">22,792.<small>17</small></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\">45,584.<small>34</small></span></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\">25,324.<small>64</small></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\">50,649.<small>27</small></span></span></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sakura\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\">25,071.<small>39</small></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\">47,863.<small>56</small></span></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\">27,857.<small>1</small></span><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\">53,181.<small>73</small></span></span></span></li>  <li>Attack type changes to AoE (Full)</li> </ul>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"click-on-I-Box&#95;&#95;Container\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-statsBox\">\n<div class=\"click-on-I-Box\" id=\"click-on-I-Box-OFF\">⁣⁣⁣⁣click on any part of the information block</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-statsBox\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"click-on-I-Box\" id=\"click-on-I-Box-ON\">⁣⁣⁣⁣click on any part of the information block</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p><p>Attacks starting from Deployment are able to hit air type enemies.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Selling\">Selling</span></h2>\n<p>Units sell for 25% of their deployment cost and upgrades.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Disclaimer\">Disclaimer</span></h2>\n<p>Upgrading Griffin (Darkness) can get very, very <b>expensive</b> depending on how many towers you sacrifice. It is <b>heavily</b> <b>not recommended</b> to sell him, as you will not be refunded yen from towers that you have sacrificed. <b>Place. Him. Carefully.</b>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sacrifice_Condition\">Sacrifice Condition</span></h2>\n<p>Griffin (Darkness) is awakened from Griffin (Ascension) using non-buffing units using his ability. His ability deletes all units within his range and depending on the value of the units the percent he gains is higher. You gain 1% for each 1000¥ spent on sacrificed units.\n</p><p>Griffin's damage multiplier can be exactly calculated with the equation: dmg multi =(cost^0.47)/6.0714. A high percentage you can get is 2551% you can get this by using <a href=\"/wiki/Berserker_(Rage)\" title=\"Berserker (Rage)\">Berserker (Rage)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Illusionist_(Final)\" title=\"Illusionist (Final)\">Illusionist (Final)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Stringy_(Awakened)\" title=\"Stringy (Awakened)\">Stringy (Awakened)</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Golden_Tyrant_(Emperor)\" title=\"Golden Tyrant (Emperor)\">Golden Tyrant (Emperor)</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Usurper_(Founder)\" title=\"Usurper (Founder)\">Usurper (Founder)</a>. With 2551% your Griffin (Darkness) can do 302,110 DPS (varies depending on stats and potential). With 2551%, Wenda, Griffin Reincarnation, and Pucci Heaven your Griffin Darkness will do 1,510,550 DPS. however this is not his max because <a href=\"/wiki/Paradox_(Divine_Sight)\" title=\"Paradox (Divine Sight)\">Paradox (Divine Sight)</a> can be given an infinite amount of upgrades because of limitless, just him to <i>Limitless 10</i> will give a total of 900k cost.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Idol_(Star)\" title=\"Idol (Star)\">Idol (Star)</a>'s <i>cost reduction</i> <b>DOES</b> affect how many percents you will get from sacrificing units. For example, sacrificing a fully-upgraded <a href=\"/wiki/Millie_(Holy)\" title=\"Millie (Holy)\">Millie (Holy)</a> will give 96% to <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Ascension)\" title=\"Griffin (Ascension)\">Griffin (Ascension)</a> without <a href=\"/wiki/Idol_(Star)\" title=\"Idol (Star)\">Idol (Star)</a>'s buff, while doing the same with <i>20% cost reduction</i> (fully-upgraded <a href=\"/wiki/Idol_(Star)\" title=\"Idol (Star)\">Idol (Star)</a>) will only give 77%.</li>\n<li>The current percentage cap for this unit is <i>unknown</i>. The more expensive the unit sacrificed, the more damage Griffin (Darkness) will gain. Therefore, theoretically, the unit's damage is infinite, as long as you have the money, time, and the appropriate unit(s) to sacrifice. Who knows when we will need a new <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Money_Units\" title=\"Category:Money Units\">Money Unit</a> to utilize this monster?</li></ul>\n<p><b><u>How to get the most damage out of <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Griffin (Darkness)</strong>?</u></b>\n</p>\n<ol><li>Get <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Ascension)\" title=\"Griffin (Ascension)\">Griffin (Ascension)</a>'s sacrifice meter to 95%+; you can, boost the meter up to 99% or even 100% (rounded of 99.5%-99.9%) but remember to calculate carefully since the unit will transform once it hits 100% and you will lose the opportunity to boost Griffin's damage further. (This unit is sellable but you will <b>NOT</b> be refunded) <i><b>(<u>Note</u>: 1k¥ spent on unit(s) = 1% sacrifice meter.)</b></i></li>\n<li>Place and fully-upgrade <b>ALL</b> of your main damage dealing units within Griffin (Ascension)'s range.</li>\n<li>Hit the <b>Sacrifice</b> ability.</li></ol>\n<ul><li>In case you have brought <a href=\"/wiki/Idol_(Star)\" title=\"Idol (Star)\">Idol (Star)</a> into the game and you still want to get Griffin (Darkness)'s damage as high as possible, you can copy the steps mentioned above; however, instead of placing <a href=\"/wiki/Idol_(Star)\" title=\"Idol (Star)\">Idol (Star)</a> at the beginning of the game, you may want to place her when you have finished all the sacrificing. By doing this, not only will you still get the maximum damage possible (without the <i>20% money discount</i>), you will also get the <i>15% damage bonus</i> from <a href=\"/wiki/Idol_(Star)\" title=\"Idol (Star)\">Idol (Star)</a>'s passive ability!</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261023000345\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.242 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.261 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1751/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 122479/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4352/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 14/100\nExpensive parser function count: 5/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 40/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.150/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 9296643/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,t